# D-ID + OpenClaw Architecture

The D-ID avatar "AIda" uses OpenClaw as its brain via a client-side relay pattern.

## Data flow

```
User voice -> Web Speech API (sv-SE) -> transcribed text
  -> POST /api/did/chat -> OpenClaw Gateway on Render
  -> response text -> agentManager.speak() -> D-ID avatar speaks
```

## Key components

- `components/did-openclaw-bridge-widget.tsx` — Main widget: D-ID Client SDK, Web Speech API, form tracking, suggestion parsing
- `app/api/did/chat/route.ts` — Backend proxy: form events + chat to OpenClaw
- `app/api/enrich/person/route.ts` — Personuppslag proxy mot `RATSIT_SCRAPER_URL`
- `lib/openclaw/server-config.ts` — Token/URL resolution (OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN, OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_URL)
- `lib/openclaw/response.ts` — Parse suggestion blocks from OpenClaw responses
- `lib/did/session-store.ts` — In-memory session history + form context

## Persondata enrichment source of truth

- The active Render service for personnummer lookups is `rats_meri_docker_scraper` (repo path: `rats_meri_docker_scraper/`).
- `app/api/enrich/person/route.ts` calls `${RATSIT_SCRAPER_URL}/lookup` and is the only supported server path for autofill persondata.
- `skrapning_ratsit/` is local tooling and should not be treated as the production web-service integration unless explicitly migrated.

## Widget uses speak() mode (not chat())

The widget calls `agentManager.speak(text)` which makes the avatar say text directly.
It does NOT use `agentManager.chat()` which would go through D-ID's LLM pipeline.
This means D-ID's LLM config (provider/model) is irrelevant — OpenClaw is the brain.

## Suggestion blocks

OpenClaw returns field suggestions as fenced code blocks:
```
Some text explanation
` ``suggestion
{"toCity": "Malmö", "toPostal": "21111"}
` ``
```
The widget parses these with `parseOpenClawResponse()` and applies values
to matching form fields via `applySuggestions()`.

## Auth chain

- Widget -> Vercel: same-origin (no auth)
- Vercel -> OpenClaw: Bearer token (OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN)
- OpenClaw -> OpenAI: Bearer token (OPENAI_API_KEY on Render)

## Important env vars

- OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_URL, OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN, OPENCLAW_AGENT_ID (Vercel)
- NEXT_PUBLIC_DID_CLIENT_KEY, NEXT_PUBLIC_DID_AGENT_ID (Vercel, build-time)
- OPENAI_API_KEY, OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN, OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PORT (Render)

